ckdiscretionaryd(8)         System Manager's Manual        ckdiscretionaryd(8)

NAME
     ckdiscretionaryd – CloudKit Discretionary Daemon

SYNOPSIS
     ckdiscretionaryd

DESCRIPTION
     ckdiscretionaryd is the system daemon that manages legacy discretionary
     CKOperation scheduling.

     There are no configuration options to ckdiscretionaryd. Users should not
     run ckdiscretionaryd manually.

